<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">Zechariah</book>
  <para style="h">Zechariah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zechariah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zechariah</para>
  <para style="mt">Zechariah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Daria lal kum hnihna, thla riatnaah chuan Idova fa, Barakia fapa zâwlnei Zakaria hnênah chuan Lalpa thu a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Lalpa chu in pate chungah khân a lungni lo êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, heti hian an hnênah va sawi rawh: Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti e, Ka lam lo hawi ula, kei pawh in lam ka lo hawi ang, Tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thu chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zâwlnei hmasaten, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan, In awm dân sual kha tûnah rawn hawisan ula, In thil tihsual chu rawn hawisan rawh u, a ti e, Tia in pate an hrilh pawha ngaithla lova, Bengkhawn lote ang khâ awm suh u,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“In pate chu khawiah nge? Zâwlneite pawh chu an nung kumkhua ta em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thu leh ka thuruatte, ka chhiahhlawh zâwlneite hnêna ka pêk khân, in pate chu a nang ta mai pawh a ni lâwm ni? Tichuan, an inlamlêt a, ‘Sipaihote Lalpa chuan, Kan chungchânga tih a tum ṭhin angin Kan awm dân ang zêl leh kan thiltih ang zêlin, Kan lakah a ti ta a ni,’ an tih kha,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Daria kum hnihna, thla sâwm leh thla khatna, chu chu Sebat thla a ni a, ni sawmhnih leh ni linaah chuan Idova fa Barakia fapa, zâwlnei Zakaria hnênah chuan Lalpa thu a lo thleng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />zânah chuan sakawr sen chunga mi pakhat chuang ka hmu a, ruama lenhmui thing zîngah hian a ding a; tin, a hnungah chuan sakawr, a sen te, a buang te, a vârte an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tah chuan kei chuan, “Aw ka lalpa, hêng hi eng nge ni?” ka ti a. Vântirhkoh mi betu chuan ka hnênah, “Hêng hi eng nge an nih keiman ka entîr ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, mi, lenhmui thing zînga ding khân a chhâng a, “Hêng hi Lalpan lei zawng zawng fang chhuak tûra a tirhte chu an nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan Lalpa vântirhkoh lenhmui thing zînga ding chu an chhâng a, “Lei zawng zawng chu kan fang chhuak tawh a, ngai rawh, lei chu a awm hle hle a, a awm mai mai a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutah Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan a chhâng a, “Aw Sipaihote Lalpa , Jerusalem leh Juda khawpui chunga he kum sawmsarih i thinurnate hi eng chen nge i khawngaih loh vang le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, vântirhkoh, thu ṭha tak, thu thlamuanawm taka mi betu chu a chhâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, vântirhkoh mi betu chuan ka hnênah, “Heti hian va au rawh,” a ti a: “Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Jerusalem leh Zion hi vei takmeuhvin ka vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, hnam nuam leng mai maite lakah chuan ka lungni lo êm êm a ni; Ka lungni lo deuh chauh a ni na a, Anmahni tâna thil ṭha lo chu an tizual ta a ni.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Zahngaihna nên Jerusalem lam ka hawi leh mêk a, Tah chuan ka in chu sak a ni ang,’ Tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni; ‘Tin, Jerusalem chungah chuan tehna zamin a la awm ang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Heti hian Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti e: ‘Ka khawpuite chu hmuingîlna avângin an vul leh ang a, Lalpa chuan Zion chu a thlamuan leh ang a, Jerusalem chu a thlang leh ang,’ Tiin va au leh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ka mit ka lên chho va, ka han en a, kî pali ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vântirhkoh mi betu hnênah chuan, “Hêng hi eng nge ni?” ka ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Hêng hi Juda te, Israel te, Jerusalem te tidarhtu kî an nih hi,” tiin mi chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan thirdêng pali mi entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, kei chuan, “Hêng hi eng rawn ti tûr nge an nih?” ka ti a. Ani chuan, “Sâwng saw tu mah dâk chhuak ngam rêng awm tawh lo khawpa Juda-te tidarhtu kî chu an ni a; mahse, hêng hi anmahni tizâm tûr leh, Juda ram tidarh tûra an laka an ki rawn hmangtu hnamte kî chu paih thla tûra lo kal an nih hi,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ka mit ka lên chho va, ka han en a, mi pakhat, a kuta tehna keng hi ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, kei chuan, “Khawiah nge i kal dâwn?” ka ti a. Ani chuan ka hnênah, “Jerusalem hi a vâng eng tia nge a niha, a dung eng chen nge a nih hre tûra teh tûrin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, vântirhkoh mi betu kha a kal chhuak ta a; tin, vântirhkoh dang amah tâwk tûrin a lo chhuak bawk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a hnênah, “Tlân la, he tlangvâl hnênah hian, ‘Jerusalem hi a mi tam vâng leh ran rual tam vângin Khaw hungna nei lo anga luahin a awm dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei hi a vêlah mei kulh ka ni ang a, A laia ropui chu ka ni dâwn bawk si a,’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,” tiin hrilh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hawh teh u, hawh teh u, hmâr ram ata tlân chhuak rawh u,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Vân thli pali ang maiin ka tidarh tawh si che u a,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Hawh teh, Zion, Babulon fanu zînga la chêng, relh bo rawh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti si a: “A ropuina chuan nangmahni rawktu che u hnamte hnênah min tîr a ni; Nangmahni khawihtu che u chuan a mitnautê an khawih a ni mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, ka kut ka thin khum dâwn si a, Anmahni rawngbâwltute râllâk an ni mai ang. Tichuan, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan mi tîr a ni tih in la hre dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zion fanu, hlimin zai rawh! Ngai rawh, ka lo kal e, I hnênah ka chêng dâwn si a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Chumi nîah chuan hnam tam takin Lalpa chu an rawn zawm ang a, Ka mite an ni ang; Tin, i hnênah chuan ka chêng ang a, Tichuan, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan i hnênah mi tîr a ni, tih i hre tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ram thianghlima a chanvo atân Juda chu a rochung ang a, Jerusalem chu a la thlang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi zawng zawngte u, Lalpa hmaah chuan ngawi ṭhiap rawh u; Ani chu a hmun thianghlim ata a lo tho tawh si a, Tiin va sawi rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalber Josua, Lalpa vântirhkoh hmaa ding leh a dodâltu tûr Setana ama ding lampanga ding chu mi entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Setana hnênah, “Aw Setan, Lalpa chuan hau che rawh se! A ni, Lalpa , Jerusalem thlangtu chuan hau che rawh se! He mi hi thingthu, mei ata phih chhuah chu a ni lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Josua chu silhfên bawlhhlawh taka inthuamin vântirhkoh hmaah chuan a lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a hmaa dingte chu a han bia a, “A silhfên bawlhhlawh kha hlihsak rawh u,” tiin. Tin, ama hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh, i khawlohnate chu ka tihbosak ta chia; tichuan, silhfên hlu takin ka thuam ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan, “Lukhum mawi tak khumtîr rawh se,” ka han ti a. Tichuan, lukhum mawi fe chu an khumtîr ta a, silhfênin an thuam a; tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu a kiangah a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan Josua hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Ka kawngte i zawh zêla, ka thu tukte i tih chuan, Ka in chhûng ro i rêl ang a, Ka rorêl hmunte chu i vawng bawk ang a, Hêng dinghote zîngah hian tel ve theihna tûr ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tûnah ngai teh, aw Josua, puithiam lalber, Nang leh i ṭhiante i hmaa ṭhute nên ngai rawh u, Thil ṭha thleng entîr lâwkna an ni si a; Ngai teh u, ka chhiahhlawh Chawrno chu ka rawn chhuah dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh mah u, Josua hmaa ka lung dah chu; Lung pakhatah chuan mit pasarih a awm a ni. Ngai teh u, a chungah chuan thil ziakte ka ziak ang a, Chu ram khawlohnate chu ni khat thilah ka la bo vek mai ang,’ Tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Chumi nîah chuan mi tinin grêp hrui hnuaiah te leh, Theipui hnuaiah te mahni ṭhenawmte in sâwm ṭheuh tawh ang,’ Tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,” tiin a tiam ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh mi betu kha a lo kal leh a, mi muhîl lai tihharh ang mai hian mi rawn tiharh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hnênah chuan, “Eng nge i hmuh le?” a ti a. Tin, kei chuan, “Rangkachak khâwnvâr dahna, a chhîpa berhbu leh chumia khâwnvâr pasarihte nên; tin, a chhîpa khâwnvâr dâwt pasarihte nei ṭheuhte leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />olive thing pahnih, berhbu ding lama pakhat, vei lama pakhat awm ka hmu,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh mi betu hnênah chuan, “Hêng hi eng nge ni, ka pu?” ka han ti leh ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh mi betu chuan mi chhâng a, ka hnênah, “Hêng hi eng nge an nih i hre lo maw?” a ti a. Kei chuan, “Hre lo, ka pu,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutah ani chuan ka hnênah, “Hêng hi Jerubabela hnêna Lalpa thu chu a ni a: ‘Chakna ni lovin, thiltihtheihna ni hek lovin, Ka thlarau zâwkin le,’ tiin Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Tu nge i nih, aw tlâng lianpui?’ Jerubabela hmaah chuan phaizâwlah i chang mai ang; Ani chuan a lung pawimawh ber chu A tâna malsâwmna nên, hlimna au aw nên a rawn thlen ang,” Tiin mi chhâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu Lalpa thu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Jerubabela kut chuan he in lungphûmte hi a phûm ta a, Ama kut bawkin a puitlin ang a; Tichuan, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan in hnênah mi tîr a ni tih in hre tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil tênau hun te hi tuin nge hmusit ni? Hlim takin an awm ang a, Jerubabela kuta dâr mûm khai chu an hmu dâwn si a; Hêng pasarihte ngei hi Lalpa mit chu an ni bawk a, Lei pum pui chungah hian an vâk vêl ṭhîn,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan ka chhâng a, a hnênah, “Heng olive thing pahnih, khâwnvâr dahna ding lam leh vei lama mi hi eng nge ni?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ka han chhâng nawn leh a, a hnênah, “Rangkachak dâwt pahnih kianga hêng olive zâr pahnih rangkachak hriak lo chhuahnate hi eng nge ni?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan mi chhâng a, “Hêng hi eng nge ni dâwn tih i hre lo maw?” min ti a. Tin, kei chuan, “Hre lo ve, ka pu,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, anin, “Hêng fapa pahnih, hriak ngah takte hi, lei pum pui Lalpa kianga dingte chu an nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tah chuan ka mit ka han lên chho leh a, ka han en a, lehkhabu zial thlâwk duai duai hi ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Eng nge i hmuh le?” a ti a. Kei chuan ka chhâng a, “Lehkhabu zial thlâwk duai duai ka hmu; a dung chu tawng sawmhnih a ni a, a vâng chu tawng sâwm a ni,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Hei hi ram pum pui chunga ânchhe kal chhuak chu a nih hi; a pang khing khat thu ang zêlin rûkru apiang chu then fai an ni dâwn si a; a lehlam thu ang zêlin chhechham apiang pawh then fai an ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Ka kal chhuahtîr ang a, rûkru inah leh ka hming chhâla dik lo taka chhechhamtu inah te chuan a lût ang a, an in chhûngah chuan a awm reng ang a, a thing phel te, a lungte chawpin a tiral vek ang,’ tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh mi betu chu a kal chhuak a, ka hnênah, “Tûnah i mit han lên chho la, kal chhuak ta kha eng nge ni en teh,” mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan, “Eng nge ni?” ka han ti a. Ani chuan, “Hei hi a ni bâwm kal chhuak ta kha,” a ti a. Amah vêkin, “Hei hi ram pum puia an khawlohna chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Suan talent khata rita chhin chu a hawng a, bâwm chhûngah chuan hmeichhe pakhat a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Hei hi Suaksuali chu a ni,” a ti a, bâwm chhûngah chuan a nem lût a; tin, suan rit tak chuan a chhîn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tah chuan ka mit chu ka han lên chho va, ka han en a, hmeichhe pahnih lo kal chhuak ka hmu a, an thlaah chuan thlî a awm a; thla chu vacha thla ang hi an nei a ni. Tin, bâwm chu lei leh vân kârah an chawi kâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan vântirhkoh mi betu hnênah chuan, “Bâwm chu hêng mite hian khawi lamah nge an kalpui dâwn?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan ka hnênah, “Sinar rama a tâna in sakna tûr lamah chuan; tin, in chu peih a nih hun chuan chutah chuan ama hmun ngeiah an dah ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan ka mit ka han lên chho leh a, ka han en a, tlâng pahnih kâra sakawrtawlailîr pali lo chhuak hi ka hmu a, tlângte chu dâr hlâwm an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tawlailîr pakhatnaa mi chu sakawr sen an ni a, tawlailîr pahnihnaa mi chu sakawr dum an ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tawlailîr pathumnaa mi chu sakawr vâr an ni a, tawlailîr palinaa mi chu sakawr hmârsai, chak tak si hi an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tah chuan ka chhâng a, vântirhkoh mi betu hnênah chuan, “Hêng hi eng nge ni, ka pu?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh chuan ka hnênah, “Hêng hi vân thli pali, leilung zawng zawng Lalpa hmaa ding ṭhîn, kal chhuakte chu an nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sakawr dum awmna tawlailîr chu hmâr lamah a kal chhuak a, a vâr awmna chuan a dawt a; tin, a hmârsai awmna chu chhim ram lamah a kal chhuak a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a sente chu an han ding chhuak a, kal chhuaha, leilung awm dân endik an nghâkhlel hle a. Chutah, vântirhkoh chuan, “Kal ta ula, leilung awm dân va endik rawh u,” a ti a. Chutichuan, lei chung zawng zawngah an vâk vêl ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, ka hnênah, “Ngai rawh, hmâr lama kalte khân hmâr ramah chuan ka rilru an tihahdam a ni,” tiin mi au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sal tâng Heldaia te, Tobija te, Jedaia te laka thil chu la la, chumi ni vêkah chuan lo kal la, Babulon aṭanga an rawn pan Zephania fapa Josia inah chuan lût rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ni, an lak ata tangkarua leh rangkachakte la la, lallukhumte siam la, Jehozadaka fapa Josua, puithiam lal lûah chuan khumtîr rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tin, a hnênah chuan, “Heti hian Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti a ni: Ngai rawh, mi a hming Chawrno chu, Ama hmun ata a lo ṭo chhuak ang a, Lalpa biak in chu a rawn sa ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa biak in ngei chu a rawn sa dâwn a ni; Ropuina chu a khum ang a, A lalṭhutthlênga ṭhuin ro a rêl ang; A lalṭhutthlêngah chuan puithiam a ni ang a, Remna ro chu an pahniha kârah a awm ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tin, lallukhumte chu Helema te, Tobija te, Jedaia te, Zephania fapa Hena te tân Lalpa inah hriat rengna tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, hla taka awmte kha an kal ang a, Lalpa in chu an rawn sa ve ang a, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan in hnênah mi tîr a ni tih in la hre dâwn a ni. Tin, Lalpa in Pathian aw chu ngun taka in bengkhawn ṭhin chuan, hêng thu hi a lo la thleng ngei ang a ti, tiin sawi rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Lal Daria kum lina, thla kuana, Kislev ni li ni takah chuan Zakaria hnênah Lalpa thu chu a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Bethel mite chuan Sarezera leh Regemeleka leh an mite an rawn tîr a, Lalpa khawngaihna chu an ngên a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa ina puithiamte hnênah leh zâwlneite hnênah chuan an sawi a: “Tûn hma kum tam fea ka lo tih tawh ṭhin angin mahni intihrangin thla nganaah chuan ka ṭap ṭhîn em ni ang?” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tah chuan Sipaihote Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Rama mi zawng zawngte leh puithiamte hnênah chuan, ‘Hêng kum sawmsarih chhûng meuh pawha thla ngana leh thla sarihnaa chaw in ngheia in lungngaih ṭhinte khân, ka hminga, keima hming meuhva chaw nghei em in nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, in eia, in in pawhin nangmahni tân in ei a, in in mai a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem leh a vêla khawpuite miin an luah khaha an hmuingîl êm êm lai leh, chhim lam leh ram phaite pawh miin an luah khah laia zâwlnei hmasate hmanga Lalpa thusawite kha, in lo hre tawh lâwm ni?’ tiin sawi rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu Zakaria hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a sawi a ni: ‘Rorêlna dik takin titlu ula, Mi tinin an unaute chungah zahngaihna leh Khawngaihna chhuah rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmeithai emaw, fahrah emaw, ram dang mi emaw, Mi rethei emaw hnehchhiah hek suh u. Tu mah rêngin in thinlungah In unaute tâna ṭha lo tûr chu suangtuah suh u,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mahse, an ngaithla duh lo va, An tukkhumchhah an chhawn a, An hriat loh nân an beng an chhu chhêt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ni, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan Zâwlnei hmasate kuta a thuthawn leh dân thute chu An ngaihthlâk loh nân An thinlungte chu lung chang tak angin an tisak ta a; Chuvângin, Sipaihote Lalpa lak ata Thinurna nasa tak a lo thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo ni a, anmahni a auh an ngaithla duh lo va, ‘Chutiang bawkin an auvin ka ngaithla bîk lo vang,’ Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An mi hriat ngai loh zîngah ṭhâwngaleivirin anmahni ka tidarh zâwk dâwn a ni. Chutiangin an hnuah chuan ram chu tihchhiat a ni tawh ang a, Tu mah an veivâk tawh lo vang; Ram nuam tak chu an tichhe dâwn si a.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Sipaihote Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Heti hian Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti a ni: ‘Zion chu vei takmeuhvin ka vei a ni, A chunga thinur khawpin a nia ka thîk ni,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Zion lam ka lo hawi leh ta a, Jerusalem laiah ka chêng ang. Jerusalem chu Thudik Khawpui tih a ni tawh ang a, Sipaihote Lalpa tlâng chu Tlâng Thianghlim tih a ni bawk ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Jerusalem kawtthlêrahte chuan pitarte leh putarte, An kum tam avânga tiang hawl boh boh tawhte pawh chu an la chêng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, kawtthlêra infiamin, khawpui kawtthlêrte chu Hmeichhe naupang leh mipa naupangin An la khat nuaih nuaih ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Chûng nîahte chuan hêng mi la awm chhunte Mithmuhah hian a mak a nih chuan, Keia mit hmuhah a mak ve kher dâwn em ni?’ Tih hi sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Ngai rawh u, ka mite chu chhak lam ram ata te, Thlang lam ram ata te ka chhan chhuak ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ka rawn hruai ang a, Jerusalem chhûngah an chêng ang; Thu dik leh felnaa ka mite an ni ang a, Kei pawh an Pathian ka ni ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Temple ngei chu sak a nih theih nâna Sipaihote Lalpa in lungphûm phûm nia Zâwlneite kâa thuchhuak, nangni tûna ngaithlatu hian In kutte tikhauh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tûn hmate khân mihring tân inhlawhna a awm lo va, Ran rawihna tûr pawh a awm hek lo; Hmêlma avângin a lût a chhuak tân Muanna eng mah a awm hek lo; Mi zawng zawng an ṭhenawmte nên ka indotîr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûnah erawh chuan, hêng mi la awm chhunte hnênah hian Tûn hma ang chu ka ni tawh lo vang,’ Tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Remna chi a awm dâwn tawh si a, Grêp hruite chuan rah a chhuah ang a, Leiin hlâwkna a chhuah bawk ang a, Vânin daifîm a tlâktîr ang; Hêng mi la awm chhunte hi chûng chu ka rochuntîr dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Hnam dangte zînga ânchhe dawng in nih ṭhin avângin, Aw Juda chhûngte leh Israel chhûngte u, Ka chhan chhuak ang che u a, Malsâwmin in la awm ang. Hlau suh ula, In kut erawh chu khauh rawh se.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hetiang hian Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti si a: ‘In thlahtuten mi tihthinur laia In chunga thil ṭha lo tih ka ngaihtuah khân, Ka inlamlêt lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tûnah hi chuan Jerusalem leh Juda chhûngte tân, Thil ṭha ka ngaihtuah leh thung dâwn a ni. Hlau suh u,’ Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hêng hi in thiltih tûr chu a ni ang: Mi tinin mahni ṭhenawm hnênah thu dik tak sawi ṭheuh ula, In kawngka bulah thu dik leh remna ro rêl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu mah rêngin in thinlungah in ṭhenawmte tâna ṭha lo tûr chu suangtuah suh ula, Dâwta chhechham chu pawm suh u Hêng zawng zawng hi ka thil huatte chu an ni,” Tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Sipaihote Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Heti hian Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti a ni: ‘Thla lina chaw nghei leh, thla ngana chaw nghei leh, thla sarihna chaw nghei leh thla sâwmna chaw ngheite chu Juda chhûngte tân chuan hlimna leh lâwmna, ruai hlimawm takah a chang ang a; chuvângin, thu dik leh remna chu ngaina rawh u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“etiangin Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti a ni: Heti hi a la ni ang a, Mipuite leh khawpui tam taka mite chu an lo kal ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, khawpui pakhat luahtute chu hmun dangah an kal ang a, Hawh u, Lalpa duhsakna ngên tûrin i kal thuai ang u khai, Sipaihote Lalpa chu i zawng ang u. Kei pawh ka kal ve ang,’ an ti ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ni, Lalpa zawng tûr leh Lalpa duhsakna ngên tûrin, Mipui tam tak leh hnam chak takte chu Jerusalem-ah an lo kal ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Chûng nîahte chuan heti hi a la ni ang a, Mi sâwm, hnam ze tinrêng aṭanga lo chhuakte chuan, Juda mi pakhat fênfualah an vuanin an chelh ang a, I hnênah Pathian a awm tih kan hriat avângin I hnênah kan kal ve dâwn e,’ an ti ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hadrak ram laka Lalpa thu phurrit leh Damaska chunga innghat tûr chu: Lalpa mit chu mite chungah leh Israel hnam zawng zawng chungah a fu si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chumi rîtu Hamath khaw chungah pawh, Tura leh Sidon pawh, an fin êm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Tura chuan kulhpui a insiam a, Tangkaruate chu vaivut ang maiin a chhêk a, Rangkachak ṭha mi chu kawtthlêra chirhdiak ang maiin a chhêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, Lalpa chuan a titlaran ang a, Tuipuia a chakna a tichhia ang a, Meia hâl faiin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Askelon chuan a hmu ang a, a hlau vang; Gaza pawhin a hmu ang a, nâ a ti êm êm ang; Tin, Ekron chu a beiseina avâng chuan a zak ang. Lalber chu Gaza ata a boral ang a, Askelon chu luahin a awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asdod-ah chuan falakho an chêng ang a, Philistia mite chapona chu ka tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An kâ ata an thisen ka la bo vang a, An ha kâr aṭangin an tenawmna ka la bo vang. Tin, anni pawh kan Pathian tâna awm chhun an ni ang a, Judai ramah chuan hotute pawh an la ni ang a, Ekron mite chu Jebus mite ang an la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ka in chu sipai rual lakah ka vêng ang a, Tu mah an kal tlangin an lêt vêl lo vang. Hnehchhiahtu tu mah an kal tlang tawh ngai lo vang, Ka mitin ka hmu tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Zion fanu, nasa takin hlim la; Aw Jerusalem fanu, au chhuak rawh! Ngai rawh, i Lal i hnênah a lo kal e; Mi fel a ni a, hnehtu a ni; Inngaitlâwm takin sabengtung chungah a chuang a, Sabengtungno chung ngeiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Ephraim lak ata tawlailîr leh Jerusalem lak ata sakawr chu ka tiboral ang a; Indona thal ngul chu ka tan ang. Hnamte hnênah chuan remna thu a sawi ang a, A rorêlna chu tuipui ata tuipui thlengin, Luipui aṭanga kâwlkil thlengin a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangma thûah pawh, i thuthlung thisen avângin, Khuarkhurum tui awm lohna ata i mi tângte chu Ka rawn tîr chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Beiseina nei mi tângte u, kulhpuiah chuan kîr ula, Vawiin ngeiah hian a leh hnihin Ka pe dâwn che u tih ka puang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Juda chu ka thal ngul atân ka kuai a, Thal ngulah chuan Ephraim ka vuah ta a ni. Aw Zion, Grik fate lakah i fate chu ka chawk tho vang a, Mi chak tak khandaih angah ka siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu an chungah a lang ang a, A thal chu kâwlphe angin a chhuak ang. Tin, Lalpa Pathian chuan tawtawrâwt a hâm ang a, Chhim lam ṭhâwngaleivir nên a kal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan anmahni a hum ang a; Anni chuan an hmêlmate chu an ei zo vang a, Virvawm lungte pawh chu an rap bet tawh ang. An in ang a, uain rui ang maiin an bengchheng ang. Berhbu khat ang maiin an khat ang a, Maichâm kil ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa an Pathian chuan a ran rualte angin Chûng nîah chuan anmahni a chhanhim ang; Lallukhuma lunghlute angin he ram chungah hian a chawisâng dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ṭhatna te chu a nasain, a mawina te chu a va nasa êm! Buhbâlte chuan tlangvâlte a tihlawhtling ang a, Uain thar chuan nulate a tihlawhtling dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ruah hnuhnûng hunah hian Lalpa chu ruah dîl rawh u; Lalpa , kâwl tiphetu ngei chu. Tin, anin lova hlobet tinrêngte tân Ruahpuivânâwn a sûrtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Milem pathian chuan eng mah lo mai a sawi a, Aisânthiamte thil hmuh chu dâwt a ni si a; Mumang dik lote an sawi a, Mi an thlamuan thlâwn a; Chuvângin, berâm rual angin mahni kawng kawng an hawi a, Berâmpu a awm loh avângin hrehawm an tuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Berâmpute chungah chuan ka thin a rim êm êm a, Kêlpate chu ka hrem ang. Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ran rual, Juda chhûngte chu a rawn kan ang a, Indonaa sakawr ṭha tak angin a siam dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lak ata a kila lung te, puan in kilhna thîr te, indona thal ngul te, Rorêltu te an lo chhuak ho dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, mi chak tak ang an lo ni ang a, Indona kawtthlêr chirhdiakah chuan an hmêlmate an rap bet ang. Lalpa chu an hnêna a awm avângin an bei nasa mai ang a, Sakawr chung chuangte chu an timualpho dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Juda chhûngte chu ka tichak ang a, Josefa chhûngte chu ka chhanhim ang. Ka hruai kîr leh ang, anni chu ka lainat si a. Tin, ka paih thlâk loh ang mai an la ni ang a; Kei hi Lalpa an Pathian chu ka ni si a, Anmahni ka ngaithla tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Ephraim mite chu mi chak tak ang an ni ang a, Uain tihlâwm angin an thinlung a lâwm ang. A ni, an fate chuan an hmu ang a, an hlim ang a; Lalpa -ah chuan an thinlung a lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka faifûk ang a anmahni ka ko khâwm ang, Anni chu ka tlan tawh si a; An lo pun tawh ang ngeiin an pung zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram dang dangah ka phun darh a, Ram hla takah pawh min hre reng ang; Tin, an fate nên an awm ang a, an lo kîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata pawh ka rawn hruai kîr leh ang a, Assuria ram aṭangin ka khâwm chhuak ang. Tin, Gilead ram leh Lebanon-ah chuan ka rawn hruai lût ang a, An tân hmun a awm sêng lo hial ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, tihduhdahna tuipui chu a kal tlang ang a, Tuifâwnte chu a vua ang a: Nile luipui thûkte chu a kang ang. Assuria chapona chu tihtlâwm a ni ang a, Aigupta ram lal tiang chu a bo daih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa -ah chuan anmahni ka tichak ang a, Ama hmingin an chhukin an chho vang,” Tih chu Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I kawngte hawng rawh, aw Lebanon, I sidarte meiin a kan fai theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw fâr thing, chiau vak vak rawh, Sidar chu a tlûk tawh avângin, A ṭha ṭhate chu tihchhiat a ni tawh si a. Basan sasuate u, chiau vak vak rawh u, Ngaw dur puite pawh an ṭhiat zo tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Berâmpute chiau thâwm te tak chu! An ropuina te a chhe zo ta si. Sakeibaknei hâhum thâwm te tak pawh chu! Jordan ropuina chu a chuai ta si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa ka Pathian chuan heti hian a sawi a ni: “Ran rual talh tûrte chu enkawl rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A neitute chuan an talh ṭhîn a, Thiam lovah an inruat si lo; Anmahni hralhtute chuan, ‘ Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se, Ka lo hausa ta si a,’ an ti a; Anmahni vêngtute ngei pawhin an khawngaih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ram luahtute chu ka khawngaih dâwn tawh si lo va,” Tih chu Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Tin, ngai rawh u, mi tin mai chu A ṭhenawmpa kutah leh a lalber kutah ka pe ang. Ram chu an suasam ang a, An kut ata ka chhan chhuak lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, ran rual talh tûrte chu ka enkawl a, ran rual zînga a rethei ngei chu. Tin, tiang pahnih ka la a: pakhat chu “Duhsak” ka vuah a, a dang chu “Pumkhatna” ka vuah a; tin, ran rual chu ka châwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, thla khat chhûngin berâmpu pathumte chu ka tiboral a. Ka nunna hian anmahni ka ning tawh êm si a; anni nunna pawhin mi haw bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, keiin, “Ka châwm lo vang che u. A thi thi chu thi mai sela, tihboral tûr tûr chu tihboral ni rawh se; tin, a bâng zawngte chu an tisa inei hlawm rawh se,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thuthlung, mipuite hnêna ka thlun chu ka phelh theihna tûrin ka tiang Duhsak chu ka la a, ka tan bung hmawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan phelhin a awm ta a, ran rual zînga a rethei, mi pawisatute chuan Lalpa thu a ni tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah chuan, “Ṭha in tih chuan ka hlawh chu mi pe ula, in tih loh chuan mi pe suh u,” ka ti a; chutichuan, ka hlawh atân chêng sawmthum an bûk chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Ka man atâna ṭha âwm tâwk an chhiar chu bêlvawtu pe mai rawh,” a ti a. Tin, chêng sawmthum chu ka la a, Lalpa inah, bêlvawtu hnênah chuan ka pe ta mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda leh Israel-te inkâra inunauna chu ka tihchah theih nân ka tiang dang Pumkhatna ngei chu ka la a, ka tan chhum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Berâmpu tlâktlâi lo hriamhrei chu va la leh cheu vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ngai rawh, ramah chuan berâmpu ka din chhuahtîr ang a, Chu chuan tihbo tûrte chu a ngaihsak lo vang a, A notête chu a zawng hek lo vang; Hliam tuarte chu a tidam lo vang a, A hrisêlte pawh chu a châwm hek lo vang; A thau sate chu a ei zâwkin, An tinkâwmte nên lam a thlawn vek zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Berâmpu tlâktlâi lo, ran rual kalsantu chung chu a pik e! Khandaih chu a bânah leh a mit ding lamah a tla ang! A bân chu a ro zo vek ang a, A mit ding lam chu a del hmiah ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel chung thûa Lalpa thu phurrit chu. Lalpa , vân tipharhtu, leilung nghahchhan phûmtu, Mihring chhûnga thlarau siamtu thuchhuak chu heti hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, Jerusalem chu a vêla mipui zawng zawngte tân Ruihna novah ka siam ang a, Jerusalem ang bawkin Judai ram pawh an hual ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Jerusalem chu mipui zawng zawng tân Lung rit takah ka siam ang; Chumi tihsawn tumtu zawng zawng chu na takin an inhliam ang a, Leia hnam zawng zawng chu amah bei tûrin an pung khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan sakawr tin mai chu ka ṭhâwng ang a, A chunga chuangte chu âtnain ka hrem ang, Tih chu Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Tin, Juda chhûngte chungah chuan ka mit ka meng ang a, Mipui sakawrte chu mitdelnain ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Juda hotute chuan, “Jerusalem luahtute chu, Sipaihote Lalpa an Pathian chu an chakna a ni,” an ti rilru ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Juda hotute chu Thing zînga meivâm angin ka siam ang a, Buhphal zînga meichher angin ka siam ang; Tin, a vêla mipuite chu a kâng fai ang - ding lam leh vei lamah; Tin, Jerusalem chu ama hmun ngei, Jerusalem-ah chuan a ding leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Davida chhûngte ropuina leh Jerusalem luahtute ropuina chu, Juda khûma tihlena a awm loh nân Lalpa chuan Juda puan inte chu A chhan chhuak hmasa ber bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Lalpa chuan Jerusalem luahtute chu a hum ang a; Chumi nîah chuan an zînga mi chhiaṭhate pawh chu Davida ang an lo ni ang; Tin, Davida chhûngte chu Pathian ang an lo ni ang a, An hmaa Lalpa vântirhkoh ang chu an lo ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Jerusalem beitu hnamte chu tihboralna ka zawng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Davida chhûngte chungah leh Jerusalem luahtute Chungah chuan, khawngaihna leh dîlna thlarau ka leih ang a; Tin, an chhuna chu mi rawn en ang. Tin, miin a fapa neih chhun a sûn angin a sûn ang a, Miin a fa tîr chunga a tuar angin an tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Jerusalem-ah sûnna nasa tak a awm ang a, Megido ruama Hadad-rimmon hmuna sûnna ang mai kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ram chuan a sûn ang, chhûngkua kuain a hrangin; Davida thlah chhûngkua pawh a hrangin, an nupuite a hrangin; Nathana thlah chhûngkua a hrangin, an nupuite a hrangin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Levia thlah chhûngku a hrangin, an nupuite a hrangin; Simeia chhûngte a hrangin, an nupuite a hrangin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chhûngkaw dang zawng zawng pawh, Chhûngkaw tinrêng a hrangin, an nupuite a hrang ṭheuhvin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan sual leh bawlhhlawhna tlen fai nân, Davida chhûngte leh Jerusalem luahtute hnênah tuikhur hawnin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak chu heti hi a ni ang: Ram ata milem hmingte chu ka tibo vang a, Hriat rengin an awm tawh lo vang. Tin, ram ata zâwlneite leh thlarau bawlhhlawh chu Ka chhuah botîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, tu pawhin thu a la hril cheu chuan A nu leh a pa amah hringtute khân a hnênah, I nung lo vang, Lalpa hmingin dâwt i sawi si a, an ti ang. Tin, a nu leh a pa, amah hringtute khân, thu a sawi laiin Amah chu an chhun tlang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan heti hi a lo ni ang a, zâwlneiin thu a hrilin, A inlârna hmuh apiang chu a zahpui tawh ang; Mi bum nân kawrfual hmulte an ha hek lo vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Zâwlnei ka ni lo va, hlo thlo mi ka ni e, Ka tleirâwl tirh ata bâwiha siam ka ni si a,” a ti zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, mi tuin emaw a hnênah, “I bân inkâra hliamte hi eng nge ni?” a ti ang a, Tin, anin, “Hêngte hi chu, ka ṭhiante ina ka hliam a nih hi,” Tiin a chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw khandaih, ka berâmpu leh ka kawppuipa chungah chuan Harh rawh, tih chu Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Berâmpu chu vua la, berâm rual an darh ang; A note chungah chuan ka kut ka lek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, ram zawng zawngah Hmun hnih zêl tihchhiat a ni ang a, a thi ang; Hmun thumna erawh chu hnutchhiah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, hmun thumna chu meiin ka fiah ang, Tangkaraw tihthianghlim angin anmahni ka tithianghlim ang a, Rangkachak fiaha a awm angin anmahni ka fiah ang. Ka hming an lam ang a, anmahni ka ngaithla ang. Tin, “Anni chu ka mite an ni,” ka ti ang a, Annin, “ Lalpa chu kan Pathian a ni,” an ti ang, Tih chu Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa ni chu a lo thleng dâwn e, Chutah chuan in râllâkte in zîng ngeiah sem darh a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem do tûrin hnam zawng zawng ka khâwm dâwn si a; Khawpui chu lâk a ni ang a, inte pawh chu rawk a ni ang a, Hmeichhiate chu nghaisak an ni ang. Khawpui zâtve chu sala hruai chhuahin an awm ang a, Mipui la awm chhunte chu khawpui ata tihbo an ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutih hnuah chuan Lalpa chu a chhuak ang a, Indona nia a beih ṭhin angin chûng hnamte chu a do vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan Olive tlâng chhak lama, Jerusalem rawn chhawngah chuan a ke a nghat ang a. Tin, Olive tlâng chu chhak leh thlang zâwngin, A laiah a phel ang a, ruam nasa tak a awm ang; Tin, tlâng tiave chu hmâr lamah a insawn ang a, A tiave chu chhim lamah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ka tlâng kâr ruamah te chuan in tlân bo vang a, Tlâng kâr ruam chuan Azel hmun a thleng dâwn si a; A ni, in tlân bo vang, Juda lal Uzia lal laia Lîrnghînga in tlân bo ang khân. Tin, Lalpa ka Pathian chu a lo kal ang a, A mi thianghlim zawng zawngte pawh i hnênahan lo kal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, A êng lutuk lo vang a, a thim lutuk lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mahse, chumi ni chu Lalpa chauhvin a hria. Chhûn ni lo, zan ni lo; tlai lamah erawh chuan êng a lo awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Jerusalem aṭangin tui nung a lo chhuak ang a, A zâtve chhak lam tuipuiah, a zâtve thlang lam tuipuiah; Nipuiah leh thlasikah pawh chuti chu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, lei chung zawng zawngah Lalpa chu Lalber a lo ni ang. Chumi nîah chua Lalpa chu pakhat a ni ang a, A hming pawh pakhat a ni ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ram zawng zawng chu Geba aṭanga Jerusalem chhim Rimon thlengin Araba ang a lo ni ang. Tin, Jerusalem chu chawi sânin a awm ang a, Benjamina Kawngka an tih aṭanga kawngka pakhatna thlengin, A kil kawngka thleng chuan; Tin, Hananela in sâng aṭanga lalber uain sâwr khur thlengin A hmun chuan a awh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, tah chuan mite an chêng ang; Anchhia rêng rêng a awm tawh lo vang a, Jerusalem chu him takin a awm zâwk dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem dotu mipui zawng zawng chunga Lalpan hripui a lêntîr tûr chu hei hi a ni: An kea an ding reng chungin an tîsa chu a ral ang a, An mitkhur chhûnga an mitte pawh chu a ral ang a, An ka chhûnga an lei pawh a ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpa hnên ata buaina nasa tak an zîngah a awm ang a, Mi tinin a ṭhenawm kut a chelh ang a, A ṭhenawm kut chungah a kut a lek bawk ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Juda pawhin Jerusalem chu a bei ang; A vêla hnam zawng zawng sum leh pai, Rangkachak te, tangkarua te, silhfên te chu, Tam tak mai lâk khâwm a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chutiang bawkin sakawr hri te, sabengtung hri te, Sanghâwngsei hri te, sabengtung tê chi hri te a lo awm ang a; Tin, chûng bûka ran awm zawng zawngte vei chu Hripui ang bawk kha a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Hnam zawng zawng, Jerusalem rawn dotu hnutchhiaha la awmte chu, Kum tin bâwkte kût hmang tûr leh Lalber, Sipaihote Lalpa chibai bûk tûrin an chho ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, lei chunga chhûngkua zawng zawng, Lalber, Sipaihote Lalpa chibai bûk tûra Jerusalem-a chho lo apiangte chungah chuan ruah a sûr lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta ram chhûngkua, kal chho lova, Kal ta lote chungah chuan a sûr bîk hek lo vang a, Bâwkte kût hmang tûra kal chho lo hnamte Lalpan a hremna chi hripui chu a thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hei hi Aigupta ram hremna leh Bâwkte kût hmang tûra Kal chho lo hnamte hremna chu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan sakawr ṭhi-ah te pawh ‘ Lalpa tana thianghlim’ tih a chuang ang. Tin, Lalpa ina bungbêl zawngte chu, Maichâm hmaa maihûn ang hial an lo ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ni e, Jerusalem leh Juda bungbêl zawng zawng chu, Sipaihote Lalpa tâna thianghlim an lo ni tawh ang. Tin, inthawi zawng zawngte chuan an rawn la ang a, Chhum nân an hmang ang. Chumi nîah chuan Sipaihote Lalpa inah chuan Kanaan mi rêng rêng an awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
</usx>
